llow-on caching work is\n  explicitly marked deferrable; if not, the caching work is confirmed as\n  required for launch.\n\n## HLR Traceability\n\n- Supports the Performance NFR attached to the P0 artifact-serving HLRs\n  (HLR-1 through HLR-3): workspace resolution adds a store lookup and\n  validation per artifact request; no latency target is specified in the RFE\n  or architecture context.\n"}}],"model":"rits/zai-org/glm-5-3","stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":91882,"output_tokens":0},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":"chatcmpl-tool-8865428d5e28a0d8","agent_id":"a654abfb6cba3ce32","session_id":"c475d54c-6029-4a26-8892-bfb5b0182313","uuid":"8058853e-d749-408d-8805-fe3f96157b66","timestamp":"2026-10-25T19:31:21.449Z","subagent_type":"claude","task_description":"Decompose RHAISTRAT-8009"}
