or is independent of audit emission).\n- Tests cover event content and emission for all denial paths.\n\n## HLR Traceability\n\n- HLR-8 (P2): audit logging for workspace access denials in artifact serving\n  through server logs (or the channel selected by the decision this epic is\n  gated on).\n"}}],"model":"rits/zai-org/glm-5-3","stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":93526,"output_tokens":0},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":"chatcmpl-tool-8865428d5e28a0d8","agent_id":"a654abfb6cba3ce32","session_id":"c475d54c-6029-4a26-8892-bfb5b0182313","uuid":"037cbf90-06b1-4b2e-bf3b-f731f902e45d","timestamp":"2026-10-25T19:32:16.224Z","subagent_type":"claude","task_description":"Decompose RHAISTRAT-8009"}
