  initialized.\n51\t- Verification that workspace resolution from artifact request paths\n52\t  resolves the parent experiment's workspace assignment and delegates\n53\t  authorization correctly, producing correct allow/deny decisions.\n54\t- Tests (plugin-level and integration against a workspace-aware\n55\t  artifacts-only server instance) covering workspace member and non-member\n56\t  artifact requests.\n57\t\n58\t## Acceptance Criteria\n59\t\n60\t- Workspace resolution initializes in the artifacts-only server context\n61\t  without tracking store initialization, demonstrated by test evidence.\n62\t- Workspace resolution from artifact request paths produces correct\n63\t  authorization decisions: member requests allowed, non-member requests\n64\t  denied, consistent with the workspace-aware artifact serving behavior.\n65\t- Regression tests are merged covering workspace resolution in the\n66\t  artifacts-only context.\n67\t\n68\t## HLR Traceability\n69\t\n70\t- HLR-7 (P1, raised to P0 by inheritance): auth plugin workspace resolution\n71\t  functions correctly in the artifacts-only context without tracking store\n72\t  initialization.\n73\t- Co-enables HLR-2 (P0): end-to-end workspace-validated artifact serving.\n74\t\n75\t## Branch Condition\n76\t\n77\tSelected when the plugin-coupling investigation determines workspace\n78\tresolution is not coupled to tracking store initialization. If that outcome\n79\tdoes not hold (coupling is found), this epic is rewritten to include the\n80\trefactoring work of the alternative plan (independent initialization path\n81\twithin the plugin).\n82\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"chatcmpl-tool-bca13937492c95c2","agent_id":"a4b202be07365c067","session_id":"c475d54c-6029-4a26-8892-bfb5b0182313","uuid":"f8773777-72d5-4c0f-979a-37cf3c721e33","timestamp":"2026-10-25T19:39:26.722Z","tool_result_meta":[{"id":"chatcmpl-tool-838316e81767f7a2","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"}}],"subagent_type